  <div class="star"><p><strong>Vanessa Spero</strong>, BS Psychology '17 and MA Mental Health Counseling and Criminal Justice '19, is a licensed Co-Response Clinician with the Malden Police Department and Eliot Community Human Services, a role that pairs behavioral health expertise with public safety.</p></div>
</div>

<!-- ============== 3 ============== -->
<div class="sector" id="s3" style="border-top-color:#40C1AC">
